<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Materi Eksponen - Matematika</title>
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f8fafc; }
        .nav-back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        .header-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e40af); color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .formula { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 15px; border-left: 5px solid #2563eb; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 1.1em; }
        .btn-check { background-color: #1e40af; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px; }
        .ans-box { display: none; margin-top: 15px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-back">← Kembali ke Menu</a>
    
    <div class="header-card">
        <h1>Eksponen & Aljabar</h1>
        <p>Kelas X • Semester 1</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>1. Sifat Dasar</h2>
        <div class="formula">\[ a^m \times a^n = a^{m+n} \]</div>
        <div class="formula">\[ \frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n} \]</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>2. Latihan Soal</h2>
        <p><strong>Soal 1:</strong> Sederhanakan \( \frac{(2x^3y^{-2})^2}{x^2y} \)</p>
        <button onclick="toggle('ans1')" class="btn-check">Cek Pembahasan</button>
        <div id="ans1" class="ans-box">
            <strong>Pembahasan:</strong><br>
            Hasilnya adalah \[ \frac{4x^4}{y^5} \]
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function toggle(id) {
            var x = document.getElementById(id);
            x.style.display = (x.style.display === "none" || x.style.display === "") ? "block" : "none";
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
